# recipes/gemma4-26b-a4b-gguf-mtp-rtx5090-c1.env — sourced by scripts/reproduce.sh on the pod.
# gemma-4-26B-A4B-it UD-Q4_K_XL GGUF + unsloth MTP head · llama.cpp build 10818 (official server-cuda container) · 1x GeForce RTX 5090 · single stream — 407.0 tok/s, Verified, #1 of 79
# Measured run: results/gemma4-26b-a4b-gguf-mtp-rtx5090-c1/payload.json — https://www.localmaxxing.com/en/runs/cmtplgojv02tcn701uyzagsof  (Verified: yes)
# 17 GB main GGUF + ~1 GB MTP head; this node burst 117 MB/s then throttled to 13-25 MB/s (~10 min). Needs an executor with docker-in-docker; the container starts in < 1 min. Session: 27 min = $0.27 including the n-max sweep.

RECIPE_TITLE="gemma-4-26B-A4B-it UD-Q4_K_XL GGUF + unsloth MTP head · llama.cpp build 10818 (official server-cuda container) · 1x GeForce RTX 5090 · single stream — 407.0 tok/s, Verified, #1 of 79"
GPU=RTX5090                        # `lium up --gpu` value
GPU_PRICE_OBSERVED_USD_H=0.60          # what `lium ps` showed for this node on 6 Sep 2026
ENGINE=llama.cpp                     # vllm | llama.cpp
HF_ID=unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF
SERVED_MODEL=gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-UD-Q4_K_XL
QUANT=Unsloth-Dynamic-Q4_K_XL
MODELS="unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF::*UD-Q4_K_XL*.gguf unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF::mtp-*.gguf"   # hf download targets: "org/repo" or "org/repo::<include-glob>"
CONCURRENCY=1
ITERATIONS=5                          # timed iterations (after 2 untimed warm-ups); median reported
MAX_TOKENS=1024
RUN_NAME=gemma4-26b-a4b-udq4kxl-mtp-n5__rtx5090x1__llamacpp__c1
MEASURED_TOKS_OUT=407                # our result, for the comparison line at the end

# Serve line — VERBATIM from the measured run's payload (engineFlags.commandSnippet). For llama.cpp recipes these are the
# arguments passed to the official ghcr.io/ggml-org/llama.cpp:server-cuda container (reproduce.sh adds the docker run prefix).
read -r -d '' SERVE_CMD <<'SERVE' || true
-m /models/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf --alias gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-UD-Q4_K_XL -c 32768 -ngl 99 -fa on -np 1 --no-mmap --jinja --reasoning-format none --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --spec-type draft-mtp -md /models/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF/mtp-gemma-4-26B-A4B-it.gguf -ngld 99 --spec-draft-n-max 5
SERVE

# `notes` field submitted with the run — verbatim from the payload (reproduce.sh appends "reproduction" to it).
read -r -d '' NOTES <<'NOTES' || true
Rented 1x NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (32 GB) on Lium (lium.io), PyTorch CUDA Ubuntu 24.04 template. llama.cpp 0.4.0-dev (build 10818, commit 4d9176092) (official ghcr.io/ggml-org/llama.cpp:server-cuda container), unsloth UD-Q4_K_XL GGUF + unsloth MTP head (mtp-gemma-4-26B-A4B-it.gguf, --spec-type draft-mtp, --spec-draft-n-max 5; lossless), all layers on GPU, flash attention on, canonical LocalMaxxing reasoning-v1 prompt, greedy, batch 1, max_tokens 1024, 2 warmups + 5 timed iterations (median). Power = mean nvidia-smi power.draw over active samples of the timed window. Draft/accepted counts from llama.cpp timings of the companion request.
NOTES
